  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Best for Oily, Combo, Normal Skin</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Good for: Pores</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A two-in-one makeup remover and cleanser that thoroughly removes sunscreen and makeup while providing gentle exfoliation for soft, never stripped, skin.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skin Type:</strong> Normal, Dry, and Oily</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Skincare Concerns:</strong> Dullness, Loss of Firmness and Elasticity, and Uneven Texture</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Highlighted Ingredients:<br></strong>- Oat: Derived surfactants gently cleanse without stripping the skin.</p><p>- PHA: Gently exfoliates so skin appears brighter and smoother.</p><p>- Plant-Derived Humectants: Replenish hydration.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> This product is vegan and cruelty-free.</p><p><br></p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Shake well and apply two to four pumps onto dry or wet skin.<br>-Massage in circular motions for at least 30 seconds and rinse thoroughly with warm water.<br>-The formula is gentle enough for use in both the morning and at night.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\"><p>-Oat Derived Surfactants: Gently cleanse without stripping the skin.</p><p>-PHA: Gently exfoliates so skin appears brighter and smoother.</p><p>-Plant-Derived Humectants: Replenish hydration.</p><p><br></p><p>Water (Aqua/Eau), Jojoba Esters, Isononyl Isononanoate, Neopentyl Glycol Dicaprylate/Dicaprate, Decyl Glucoside, Glycerin, Cocamidopropyl Hydroxysultaine, Sodium Methyl Cocoyl Taurate, Sodium Citrate, Betaine, Gluconolactone, Hydroxyacetophenone, Saccharide Isomerate, 1,2-Hexanediol, Caprylyl Glycol, Sodium Lauroyl Oat Amino Acids, Citric Acid, Caramel, Xanthan Gum, Sclareolide, Tocopherol, Bacillus Ferment.</p><p><br></p><p><em>The list of ingredients is subject to change. Please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</em></p></div></details>",
